      },
      "id": "RLZ-D8Y5FWWB",
      "invariant": "INV-1BRT5DX6",
      "origin": {
        "leaf": "260921-ICR-L46"
      },
      "rationale": "Feeds the graph view only payloads that carry the task-document schema, read from the candidate paths for the refs the graph's nodes name, into the same _master_docs_by_ref join the corpus-wide table uses. The graph therefore sees the same entries for those refs, and a schema-less master-shaped JSON cannot enter the join.",
      "role": "support"
    },
    {
      "anchor": {
        "blob": "4a89bddef7bc24b65b4721cbaab875366daaeb20",
        "content": "sha256:8c8a9080ec2470467a7e0a4ff4b51136f348aee65991f4e5fa1486cdd592a650",
        "locator": {
